  "details": "The kernel packages contain the Linux kernel, the core of any Linux operating system.  \n\nSecurity Fix(es):  \n\n  * kernel: ethtool: coalesce: cap profile updates at NET_DIM_PARAMS_NUM_PROFILES (CVE-2026-63987)\n  * kernel: ethtool: cmis: require exact CDB reply length (CVE-2026-63996)\n\n\nFor more details about the security issue(s), including the impact, a CVSS score, acknowledgments, and other related information, refer to the CVE page(s) listed in the References section.\n",
